config BR2_PACKAGE_TT_RUST_STD
	bool "rust_std_hello, rust_std_demo (experimental)"
	default y
	help
	  Rust programs using the full standard library, with a custom
	  target, patched libc/std and a pthread shim. Needs rustup with a
	  nightly toolchain and rust-src, and network access to crates.io
	  (skipped with a warning without cargo). Source: linux/apps/rust-std.
